# The rubble pile of a destroyed 1x1 tile building: a render-only entity the game puts on the building's ground point
# while the building is rubble (StructureSystem::setRubble). Its origin is on the ground.
Prefab gameRubble1
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer rubble
		Node Rubble1
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.2 0.18 0.16
